<div class="card">
  <div class="label" style="margin-bottom:8px">参数</div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="kv"><span>响应阈值 deadband</span><span><input type="number" id="pDead" min="0" max="20" step="0.5" oninput="markDirty()"> %</span></div>
    <div class="kv"><span>最小步进 minStep</span><span><input type="number" id="pStep" min="0.5" max="20" step="0.5" oninput="markDirty()"> %</span></div>
    <div class="kv"><span>轮询间隔 interval</span><span><input type="number" id="pInt" min="0.2" max="5" step="0.1" oninput="markDirty()"> s</span></div>
    <div class="kv"><span>外接下限 clamp</span><span><input type="number" id="pLo" min="0" max="100" step="1" oninput="markDirty()"> %</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hint">改完参数点和曲线一样都要点「保存」。未保存时页面不会自动刷新覆盖你的输入。</div>
